ENV-GHG-001B	Scope 1 – Mobile Combustion	Direct GHG emissions from fuel combustion in mobile sources owned or controlled by the entity: company cars, trucks, buses, construction equipment (excavators, cranes, compactors), and marine vessels. Source: BEE PAT Manual 2023 / IPCC 2006. Report in tCO2e.	environment	Section C	6	essential	t	Scope 1 GHG – Mobile	numeric	tCO2e	["tCO2e", "kgCO2e"]	sum	\N	\N	mandatory	monthly	site_collector	CALC-GHG-SCOPE1-MOBILE	5741c3b7-f547-4356-af45-2a7767b5a399	2026-10-06 12:45:06.932284+00	2026-10-06 16:57:30.510025+00	f	project	Enter total fuel consumed in excavators, cranes, compactors, trucks, and other mobile equipment at this site.	Scope 1 mobile combustion under GHG Protocol and SEBI BRSR. One of the highest emission sources in construction projects.	Upload equipment fuel logbook (vehicle-wise daily diesel issue register) or bulk fuel tanker receipts.
